  "body": "### Description\r\n\r\nAS spec states events should be \"formatted as per the Client-Server API\", but state events sent to ASes don't include the `prev_content` field.\r\n\r\n### Version information\r\n\r\nOccurs as of 1.50.\r\n\r\n### Ref\r\n\r\nSayeth vdh:\r\n\r\n> `ApplicationServiceTransactionWorkerStore.get_new_events_for_appservice` is missing `get_prev_content=True` in its call to `get_events_as_list`",
